/// ### What it does
/// Disallow the use of rest patterns for accessible fields
///
/// ### Why restrict this?
/// It might lead to unhandled fields when the struct changes.
///
/// ### Example
/// ```no_run
/// struct S {
///     a: u8,
///     b: u8,
///     c: u8,
/// }
///
/// let s = S { a: 1, b: 2, c: 3 };
///
/// let S { a, b, .. } = s;
/// ```
/// Use instead:
/// ```no_run
/// struct S {
///     a: u8,
///     b: u8,
///     c: u8,
/// }
